  Imp: diarrhea, nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain.
  PE: normal vital signs, no abdominal tenderness, no masses, normal bowel sounds.
  Imp: IBS, functional abdominal pain, exacerbated by spicy foods and alcohol.
  Plan: 
  - Start elavil 25mg at bedtime.
  - Bentyl 20mg 30-45 minutes prior to eating out.
  - Zofran as needed.
  - Avoid greasy and fatty foods and alcohol.
  - Review in one month by email regarding side effects and issues, or if adjustments are needed. }}<|eot_id|>
