summary is: {{ HPC: 1/7/90
Imp: Right elbow pain
Hx: 
Pain in right elbow, started 1 week ago, playing lacrosse with son
Pain at the tip of the elbow, sharp, radiates down the forearm
No falls, no trauma
Pain worsened with movement
T: Advil helped some
Imp: Right elbow contusion, mild pain on palpation of the olecranon area, normal ROM
Imp: Swelling, bruising
Plan: 
- Ibuprofen 800mg PO BID for 2 weeks
- Ice for 3 times a day for 20 minutes
- Avoid lacrosse for 2 weeks
Imp: HTN, DM
- HTN: Lisinopril 20mg PO daily
- DM: Metformin 500mg PO daily
- A1C in 2 weeks
