summary is: {{ HPC: 53-year-old female with a PMHx of DM, HTN, and a 3-month history of chest pain. 
Imp: Unstable angina, high blood pressure. 
Plan: 
- Aspirin 81mg daily 
- Nitroglycerin 0.4mg SL q5min PRN 
- Refer to cardiology for stress test 
- BP monitoring at home 
- HbA1c in 2 weeks 
- F/U in 2 weeks 
- Start HCTZ 12.5mg OD for HTN 
- Hx of DM: 
- Review DMP and exercise regimen 
- F/U in 2 weeks 
- Hx of HTN: 
- BP monitoring at home 
- F/U in 2 weeks 
- Hx of eye disease: 
- Review ophthalmology appointment in 2 weeks 
- F/U in 2 weeks }}<|eot_id|>
